    "title": "MANIA ABBA tribute band coming to Adler Theatre - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Sharon Wren ,\n10 hours ago\nThe world’s number one touring ABBA tribute show— MANIA: The ABBA Tribute brings its Fall 2025 Tour to Davenport’s Adler Theatre on October 15 at 7 p.m. Click here for tickets.\n(Submitted) MANIA: The ABBA Tribute was formed in 1999 and has sold out theatres and concert halls worldwide. They’ve played over 3,000 performances in over 35 countries to over three million fans. The show celebrates ABBA’s timeless music and introduces it to new generations. Audiences will dance and sing along to classic hits like “Dancing Queen,” “Waterloo,” “Mamma Mia” and “Take a Chance on Me.”\nClick here to watch the show’s preview video.\nCopyright 2025 Nexstar Media, Inc. All rights reserved. This material may not be published, broadcast, rewritten, or redistributed. For the latest news, weather, sports, and streaming video, head to WHBF - OurQuadCities.com.",
